posed to but perhaps  knowing that adam warlock was indeed  going to be coming they did actually  cast him years ago this is something  that i actually think james gunn might  address on twitter he usually does  address things concerning rumors about  guardians of the galaxy vol 3 and he  usually says if they're wrong now he  doesn't always do this so don't expect  it but it would be cool if he could  confirm or deny this and which if it is  true i doubt he would confirm it but who  knows today's report about this is  coming from thecosmiccircus.com  now they state that originally there was  a twitter post by at collectaholic  underscore that stated will poulter had  been cast as adam warlock for years now  then they stated that after they saw  this they checked with some of their own  sources several of them and all of them  seemed to say that yes this is a rumor  going around behind the scenes right now  so this is not confirmed to be true but  according to their sources this is  something that is being talked about  behind the scenes which means that it  very well could be true and i'm curious  to see what everybody thinks about this  casting choice in the comments down  below i know a lot of people were  thinking that they would cast somebody  like zac efron which i totally could  have gotten behind but let me know what  you think about this down below and  let's talk about now the shang chi  spin-off series that is coming to disney  plus according to daniel richmond daniel  rpk as he is sometimes known as shared  on his patreon account that there is  going to be a disney plus show that's a  spin-off of shanxi that is going to  focus on the 10 rings organization and  xiling now if you've seen the post  credits scene for shengqi and the legend  of the ten rings this makes perfect  sense in fact when i saw the post credit  for the first time i thought that's  going to be a disney plus show because  it's going to give it enough time enough  episodes to really dive 