y the script for ant-man  3 is really fantastic she praised the  script saying that i just think that  it's going to be really special i  actually think it has the chance to be  the best one we've done yet and i sure  hope it is the best one and i don't  think that's going to be that hard  considering kang is going to be in it  and we are going to get cassie lang as  stature and considering the fact that  the title is quantum mania i'm assuming  we're going to be getting some pretty  awesome quantum realm scenes so kang is  coming and who knows perhaps they could  introduce the fantastic four in that  movie that's just speculation at this  point not confirmed and the last thing  that we're going to be talking about is  more spider-man in marvel's what if  season 2. now it'll be cool to see  spider-man in what of season 2 but  that's not really what i want to focus  on i really want to talk about how brian  andrews the director of what if acted  when he was asked about spider-man  because i kind of think no way home is  going to affect what happens in season  two because they said season two is  actually going to pull from phase four  stuff that happens in phase four and  when brian andrews was asked by  comicbook.com if we'd see more  spider-man in season 2 he replied with  well we can't talk too much about what  may or may not be happening in season 2  but we do love spider-man so who knows  what may happen in the future i find  this interesting really because of one  reason they've actually talked about  season two before i actually interviewed  brian andrews and the writer of the show  and talked to them about what to expect  in season two and they told me a little  bit of it they told me that peggy  carter's going to come back and gave me  a little bit more detail so they've been  able to talk about season two before but  when it comes to spider-man they can't  really say anything which leads me to  believe that spider-man really is going  to be a multiversal film that affects  the mcu as a whole and who knows if we  do get the three spider-man and  spider-man no way home perhaps we could  get those in what if and hopefully that  is why he cannot talk about it but that  is just my speculation right now let me  know what you think about that and all  of this news in the comments down below  don't forget to like the video and  follow me on instagram and twitter and  as always thank you all so much for  watching woof

